{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 24, :comments ["<b>Caused to rain upon Sodom.</b> Rashi's comment: an hour when the sun stands with the moon in the firmament, for at that time of year the moon was deficient, since Passover had already begun, and the moon appears with the sun." "<b>From before HaShem.</b> It is found in Bereshit Rabbah and in Tanhuma: the first one is Gabriel, for it is established with us that that one is the prince of fire, and the second one is the Holy One, blessed be He."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:04:58.727890981Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}